@fleetops_backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107
@existingDriverId = 1
@existingVehicleId = 1
@nonExistingVehicleId = 999999
@existingTripId = 10
@nonExistingTripId = 999999

### Login
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wkwk@gmail.com",
  "password": "wkwkwkwk"
}

### Register
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Fit",
  "email": "wkwk@gmail.com",
  "password": "wkwkwkwk"
}

### Get Users
GET {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json

### Start Trip - Successful
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/trips/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": {{existingDriverId}},
  "vehicleId": {{existingVehicleId}},
  "lokasiAwal": "Jakarta",
  "lokasiAkhir": "Bandung",
  "kordAwalLatitude": -6.2088,
  "kordAwalLongitude": 106.8456,
  "odometerAwal": 1000.5
}

### Stop Trip - With Image Upload
PATCH {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/trips/{{existingTripId}}/stop
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DriverId"

{{existingDriverId}}
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="VehicleId"

{{existingVehicleId}}
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="LokasiAkhir"

Bandung
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="KordAkhirLatitude"

-6.9147
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="KordAkhirLongitude"

107.6098
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="OdometerAkhir"

1050.8
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Catatan"

Saya ini sebenarnya sudah diam 4,5 tahun. Difitnah-fitnah saya diam, dijelek-jelekkan saya diam, dicela dan direndah-rendahkan saya juga diam, dihujat, dihina saya juga diam.Tapi hari ini di Jogja saya sampaikan: Saya akan lawan! Ingat, ingat, ingat sekali lagi, akan saya lawan!
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Image"; filename="test-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testingimage/test.jpg
------FormBoundary--

### Create Vehicle - With Image
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/create
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DriverId"

{{existingDriverId}}
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="VehicleName"

My Test Truck
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="PlatNomor"

B1234XYZ
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TahunPembuatan"

2024
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Odometer"

12345
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Tipe"

Tronton
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Status"

Active
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="MuatanMax"

10000
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TipeBensin"

Solar
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Image"; filename="test-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./testingimage/test.jpg
------FormBoundary--

### Create Vehicle - Without Image
POST {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/create
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DriverId"

{{existingDriverId}}
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="VehicleName"

My Test Truck 2
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="PlatNomor"

B5678ABC
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TahunPembuatan"

2023
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Odometer"

54321
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Tipe"

Box
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Status"

Active
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="MuatanMax"

5000
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="TipeBensin"

Pertamax
------FormBoundary--

### Cancel Trip
PATCH {{fleetops_backend_HostAddress}}/api/trips/{{existingTripId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverId": {{existingDriverId}}
}
